      "data": {
        "title": "Exemplos práticos"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "3f593d47-21d6-4a96-bb33-c4e13709b84b",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 0,
          "data": {
            "language": "bash — EC2",
            "code": "# Lançar uma t3.micro (Free Tier elegível)\naws ec2 run-instances \\\n  --image-id ami-0c55b159cbfafe1f0 \\\n  --instance-type t3.micro \\\n  --key-name minha-chave \\\n  --security-group-ids sg-012345 \\\n  --subnet-id subnet-abc123 \\\n  --count 1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "7d7e9294-22bf-44b6-b250-435a12e8757f",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 1,
          "data": {
            "language": "bash — Lambda",
            "code": "# Criar função\naws lambda create-function \\\n  --function-name olaMundo \\\n  --runtime python3.12 \\\n  --role arn:aws:iam::123:role/lambda-role \\\n  --handler app.lambda_handler \\\n  --zip-file fileb://deploy.zip\n\n# Invocar\naws lambda invoke \\\n  --function-name olaMundo \\\n  --payload '{\"nome\":\"AWS\"}' resposta.json"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "d5145bb3-c271-45dc-8076-bc2c9bdf76ab",
          "type": "code_block",
          "position": 2,
          "data": {
            "language": "bash — ECS Fargate",
            "code": "# Criar task definition + rodar tarefa\naws ecs run-task \\\n  --cluster meu-cluster \\\n  --task-definition minha-task:1 \\\n  --launch-type FARGATE \\\n  --network-configuration \"awsvpcConfiguration={subnets=[subnet-abc],securityGroups=[sg-012]}\""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "56c7ed72-4080-41be-878c-222c850db51b",
      "type": "callout",
      "position": 11,
      "data": {
        "variant": "warning",
        "title": "",
        "content": "Armadilha clássica: \"Serverless não tem servidor\" é meia-verdade. O servidor existe (AWS gerencia). O ponto é que VOCÊ não gerencia. Para o exame, serverless = Lambda + Fargate + DynamoDB + Aurora Serverless + API Gateway + SQS + SNS."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "07e996e0-1328-4e81-9653-5225228ea8f0",
